		"__comment": "WC x EF step 2: let Wildcraft fruit (fresh + our dried) into EF's fruit DISHES — recipes whose output is a generic meal/dish, so the fruit is just a consumed component. We deliberately do NOT touch per-fruit producers (candiedfruit, fruitsyrup, gelatin, EF's own dryfruit) whose output code is `...-{fruit}`: adding Wildcraft fruit there would resolve to nonexistent items like candiedfruit-jackfruit. Each entry mirrors the recipe's existing `game:fruit-*` slot (same shapeElement; no textureMapping, exactly like vanilla fresh fruit, which renders no overlay in these bowls). addmerge appends every element of `value` to the existing validStacks array. EF is a hard dependency of this mod, so these targets always exist — no dependsOn needed.",
